# Runtime OpenTofu artifacts. State lives ONLY in the kubernetes-backend Secret
# tfstate-default-openbao-config (ns secret), never in git. secret:configure writes
# zz_backend.tf + zz_provider.tf at apply time and removes them after.
# .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — it pins the provider for
# reproducible inits.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
zz_backend.tf
zz_provider.tf
